  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA value remains network-concentrated:</strong> the top chains continue to capture the majority of distributed issuance and often set near-term market direction. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/15/how-brooklyn-prosecutors-and-the-fbi-took-down-a-massive-crypto-fraud-network-targeting-russian-speakers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How Brooklyn prosecutors and the FBI took down a massive crypto fraud network targeting Russian speakers</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Institutional expansion is likely staged:</strong> large-scale adoption typically lands on proven networks first, then broadens as compliance, interoperability, and liquidity deepen. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/connect-recap-tokenizations-next-challenge-is-building-liquidity-gsr-executive-says?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CONNECT recap: Liquidity is tokenization\u2019s next challenge, everyday stablecoins</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Custody and issuance integrations are moving rankings first:</strong> Chains that win custody and issuance integrations usually pull distributed value share before the broader RWA market total catches up. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/deutsche-bank-crypto-custody-expansion-asia-2027?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Deutsche Bank prepares German crypto custody launch, eyes Asia: Report</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
